      ],
      "orig": "Samples were taken every fortnight at four stations, from May to September. Each sample was filtered on site and analysed within six hours, which keeps the measured phosphorus close to its value in the lake. The official limit for bathing water was never exceeded. 1",
      "text": "Samples were taken every fortnight at four stations, from May to September. Each sample was filtered on site and analysed within six hours, which keeps the measured phosphorus close to its value in the lake. The official limit for bathing water was never exceeded. 1"
    },
