      ],
      "orig": "Water temperature peaked at 24.1 \u00b0C in early August. Visibility was lowest at station B after two days of heavy rain, when the stream carried fine sediment into the lake. The algae bloom expected for July did not occur; the lower phosphorus load of the last three years is the most likely reason, although a cool June may have contributed.",
      "text": "Water temperature peaked at 24.1 \u00b0C in early August. Visibility was lowest at station B after two days of heavy rain, when the stream carried fine sediment into the lake. The algae bloom expected for July did not occur; the lower phosphorus load of the last three years is the most likely reason, although a cool June may have contributed."
    },
